{"type":"finding","id":"f-iter002-decision-synopsis","severity":"P1","label":"Place a significant-data decision synopsis before the complete redacted canonical payload; never replace the payload with a generic summary.","iteration":2}
{"type":"finding","id":"f-iter002-two-speed-auth","severity":"P1","label":"Keep Deny and digest-bound exact approval immediate; move reusable authority into a scoped confirmation with persistent status and revocation.","iteration":2}
{"type":"finding","id":"f-iter002-typed-redaction","severity":"P1","label":"Preserve payload structure with typed non-revealable redaction and fail closed when hidden data is essential to authorization.","iteration":2}
{"type":"finding","id":"f-iter002-stale-receipts","severity":"P1","label":"Represent submitted, verified, stale, expired, settled, revoked, and failed states in-place.","iteration":2}
{"type":"finding","id":"f-iter002-queue-triage","severity":"P2","label":"Use synopsis cards for triage and one expanded exact review; progress is orientation, not an authorization gate.","iteration":2}
{"type":"invariant","id":"inv-iter002-wysiwys","label":"Mutation authorization stays bound to the exact server-known action and exposes significant redacted data before decision.","iteration":2}
{"type":"invariant","id":"inv-iter002-no-unredacted-reveal","label":"The PWA offers no unredacted reveal or side-channel leak through names, notifications, errors, analytics, copies, or persistence.","iteration":2}
{"type":"observation","id":"obs-iter002-grant-contract","packet":"044","classification":"real","label":"The accept-edits request omits visible approval ID and digest, leaving current-action inclusion unconfirmed.","iteration":2}
{"type":"ruled_out","direction":"Universal confirmation, press-and-hold, scroll-to-bottom, or Viewed gate before exact approval","reason":"Adds ceremony and accessibility friction without proving comprehension.","iteration":2}
{"type":"ruled_out","direction":"Place Accept next 3 edits beside Approve once as equivalent actions","reason":"They convey different authority scopes and use differently bound requests.","iteration":2}
{"type":"ruled_out","direction":"Reveal redacted values on demand","reason":"Creates a confidentiality path and undermines relay-owned redaction.","iteration":2}
